This file is the record of account for the fixture. The committed fixture
oss-scan-results/adapter-tests/fixtures/captured-dependency-check-vulnerabilities.json is this
file byte for byte, and the test corpus asserts that equality rather than trusting this note.

Read this file with:
  oss-scan-results/adapter-tests/expected/captured-dependency-check-vulnerabilities.rows.json
  oss-scan-results/adapter-tests/test_dependency_check_adapter.py — CapturedVulnerabilityFixtureTest
  oss-scan-results/tool-status.md — the dependency-check entry, whose zero-row outcome is a
                                    property of the scanned scope and is unaffected by this file
